This product contains source copied VERBATIM from the PGPonyAndroid repository
(Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2026 NorseHorse), located under vendor/:

    vendor/app-crypto/        the OpenPGP engine — packet handling, v4 and v6
                              (RFC 9580) keys, the post-quantum composite layer,
                              the OpenPGP smart-card protocol stack, MIME
    vendor/app-data/          the Room data layer and PGPDatabase schema
    vendor/app-backup/        the Crockford recovery-code and archive codecs
    vendor/app-network/       the keyserver, WKD and VKS stack
    vendor/app-strings/       the six localized strings.xml files
    vendor/app-crypto-tests/  the crypto unit-test suite and its fixtures

These files are not modified here. Fixes go upstream to PGPonyAndroid and are
re-synced by tools/sync-vendor.sh; see vendor/README.md for the inventory and
for the desktop-specific replacements of Android-coupled files.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product depends on third-party libraries, each under its own licence, as
declared in build.gradle.kts: Compose Multiplatform, AndroidX Room and SQLite,
Bouncy Castle, Ktor, kotlinx.serialization, org.json, and ZXing.
